        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-e-PF6" value="✕ PF6 D3,D5" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#c0392b;strokeWidth=2.0;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#c0392b;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2-n-P3" target="p2-n-C4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="605" y="545" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-e-PF2" value="✕ PF2 D1-D7,D10" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#c0392b;strokeWidth=2.0;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#c0392b;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2-n-P3" target="p2-n-E10">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-e-PF5" value="✕ PF5 D1-D7" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#c0392b;strokeWidth=2.0;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#c0392b;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2-n-E11" target="p2-n-E6">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-panel" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF1  Customer content into support and corporate tools&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P2, P3, E4, S4  to  S1, S2, S3&lt;br&gt;Data: D1-D4,D7&lt;br&gt;Control: Structured intake, redaction and data loss prevention&lt;br&gt;keep customer content out; staff attest to policy.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: DLP and intake tests with seeded sample content;&lt;br&gt;quarterly sampling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF2  Production data into staging&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P3, P4  to  E10&lt;br&gt;Data: D1-D7,D10&lt;br&gt;Control: Separate accounts, deny policies on snapshot sharing&lt;br&gt;and no restore paths from production.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Policy configuration check and restore-event audit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF3  Alert content into notification channels&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P2, P10  to  T1, T2, T3&lt;br&gt;Data: D4&lt;br&gt;Control: Payload policy: push, email, SMS and voice use&lt;br&gt;reference IDs and fixed text only. A payload linter blocks&lt;br&gt;sends that contain summary text.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Linter unit tests and sampled outbound payload&lt;br&gt;review.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF4  Identifiers and content to error tracking&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P2  to  T4&lt;br&gt;Data: D1-D4&lt;br&gt;Control: Scrubbing removes tenant, user and alert identifiers&lt;br&gt;and all content before telemetry leaves the platform.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Pipeline test that injects canary values and asserts&lt;br&gt;they never appear outbound.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF5  Unmanaged devices to production&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From E11  to  E6, P1, P2, P3&lt;br&gt;Data: D1-D7&lt;br&gt;Control: Gateway device posture checks deny any device not&lt;br&gt;enrolled in management and EDR.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Gateway policy export and denied-access log sample.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF6  Detailed usage data to billing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P3  to  C4&lt;br&gt;Data: D3,D5&lt;br&gt;Control: Export schema allows only per-tenant aggregate&lt;br&gt;counts.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Schema validation test on the export job.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;PF7  Credentials and customer content into the wiki&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From P2, P3, P6, E4, S4  to  C5&lt;br&gt;Data: D7,D8&lt;br&gt;Control: Secret scanning blocks credentials; policy and review&lt;br&gt;keep customer content out of runbooks and design documents.&lt;br&gt;Evidence: Secret scan results on the wiki and a quarterly&lt;br&gt;content sample.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1340" y="120" width="560" height="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
